Digital nomad / young family — full bedroom + work-friendly living area, on-site co-working, Nai Harn Beach 2 km away;

Downshifter-dreamer — calm low-rise setting, greenery views, generous balcony for yoga and a sea breeze.

Wallaya Residence Nai Harn is a contemporary low-rise luxury condominium in South Phuket, built around the Slow Living, Refined concept: a haven of calm, greenery and thoughtful design only 2 km from iconic Nai Harn Beach.

The development consists of three seven-storey buildings with 285 units ranging from 36 to 94 sq m (studios, 1-, 2- and 3-bedroom layouts). Glass-fronted balconies, cascading rooftop gardens and clean geometric lines blend modern aesthetics with lush tropical surroundings.

Residents enjoy a 25-metre infinity pool, kids’ pool, spa & sauna, fitness and yoga studio, co-working lounge with conference space, on-site restaurant and lounge-bar, rooftop open-air cinema, 71-bay covered parking and 24/7 security.

For investors, the developer offers a 7 % guaranteed return for three years with full pre-payment or a projected 6 % yield on the open rental market, plus a flexible instalment plan of up to five years. Completion is scheduled for Q3 2027.

